{
  "name": "Find Exact LinkedIn Profile URL from Full Name & Company Name (No Cookies)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Find Exact LinkedIn Profile URL from Full Name & Company Name (No Cookies)\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nResolve raw contact names and company names from webinar signups or event lists into verified LinkedIn profile URLs.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/linkedin-profile-search-by-name-no-cookies`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/linkedin-profile-search-by-name-no-cookies) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify LinkedIn Profile Search By Name (No Cookies)** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "39e6b03a-bd6b-4103-a4f1-3deea0531a82",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **LinkedIn Profile Search By Name (No Cookies)** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "994693ef-5d7b-469e-aa4e-11fd5086f7ef",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "973b5be0-8f60-4393-a250-40370cb33481",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
